 40px; display: block; margin: 0 auto;'><div style='text-align: center; height: 32px; font-size: 18px; font-family: \"SourceHanSansCN-Medium-2\", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; font-weight: 500; color: #182B44; line-height: 32px; margin-top: 12px;'>管理成本高</div><div style='width: 256px; margin: 8px auto 0; font-size: 13px; font-family: \"SOURCEHANSANSSC-REGULAR\", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; color: #999EA2; line-height: 22px; text-align: center;'>园区管理局限区安防、消费等有限领域，管理方式被动，缺乏根据园区不同情况调整管理策略的能力。</div></div><div style='width: 296px; height: 264px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #F1F7FF 0%, #FEFEFF 100%); box-shadow: 0px 0px 20px 0px rgba(86, 118, 162, 0.1); border-radius: 4px; border: 2px solid #FFFFFF; padding-top: 40px; box-sizing: border-box; flex-shrink: 0; text-align: center;'><img src='https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/imgs/supplement/5.png?imageView2/0/format/webp/q/74' style='width: 40px; height: 40px; display: block; margin: 0 auto;'><div style='text-align: center; height: 32px; font-size: 18px; font-family: \"SourceHanSansCN-Medium-2\", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; font-weight: 500; color: #182B44; line-height: 32px; margin-top: 12px;'>故障定位难</div><div style='width: 256px; margin: 8px auto 0; font-size: 13px; font-family: \"SOURCEHANSANSSC-REGULAR\", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; color: #999EA2; line-height: 22px; text-align: center;'>各子系统的告警方式不统一，部分告警难以准确定位故障位置，增大了故障判断错误的可能，增加运维成本。</div></div><div style='width: 296px; height: 264px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #F1F7FF 0%, #FEFEFF 100%); box-shadow: 0px 0px 20px 0px rgba(86, 118, 162, 0.1); border-radius: 4px; border: 2px solid #FFFFFF; padding-top: 40px; box-sizing: border-box; flex-shrink: 0; text-align: center;'><img src='https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/imgs/supplement/3.png?imageView2/0/format/webp/q/74' style='width: 40px; height: 40px; display: block; margin: 0 auto;'><div style='text-align: center; height: 32px; font-size: 18px; font-family: \"SourceHanSansCN-Medium-2\", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; font-weight: 500; color: #182B44; line-height: 32px; margin-top: 12px;'>多部门协同难</div><div style='width: 256px; margin: 8px auto 0; font-size: 13px; font-family: \"SOURCEHANSANSSC-REGULAR\", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; color: #999EA2; line-height: 22px; text-align: center;'>需要协调涉及多类硬件、软件、设施设备不同部门不同岗位的人员，管理较为粗放，管控培训难度高。</div></div></div></div>"
